# neatlogs tracing. Project ID: be800dc6-4fa9-4f52-8a7d-45d1a815cb28
# Put the project API key in .env.local (never commit it), then restart the server.
# Without a key the app runs normally and tracing is off.
NEATLOGS_API_KEY=

# Optional: local model used to write the ruling explanation and merchant message.
# llama2 runs at about 3 to 5 tokens/s on a laptop, so it only writes the email subject line (runs take 5 to 9 s).
# llama3.2 (3B) is much faster in testing and also explains conflict rulings.
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama2

# The address the site is deployed at, used for share-card image links.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-site.example
